   |
help: finish with `letters` before `score` changes, or copy the text first with `constant kept = score`, and show `kept`

error[L0701]: `gone` would show a value that is freed at the end of this statement
  --> tests/check/text_roots.lym:35:21
   |
35 |     constant gone = bytes("built{4}")
   |                     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ this value has no binding, so it lasts only as long as its statement
